 rtistvillage.org.tw/ before 11:59:59 (Taipei time\, late morning) on Tuesd
 ay 30 June 2026. Questions: air@artistvillage.org.\n\nOrganisation: Taipei
  Culture Foundation (AIR Taipei\, operating Taipei Artist Village and Trea
 sure Hill Artist Village)\nLocation: Taipei\, Taiwan\; on-site residency.\
 nAward: Funding varies by track. INTERNATIONAL RESIDENCY (open to internat
 ional artists): free accommodation and studio space plus administrative an
 d project support\; no cash artist grant. PUPPETRY RESIDENCY (Treasure Hil
 l x Puppetry Art Center\, open to international artists): NT$20\,000 (arou
 nd USD 620) subsidy plus accommodation and studio. OVERSEAS RESIDENCY VISI
 T (Taiwanese artists only): NT$100\,000 (around USD 3\,100) creative grant
  plus economy-class roundtrip airfare. No application fee.\nDuration: Appr
 ox. 6 weeks to 3 months depending on category (International Residency rou
 ghly 8 to 12 weeks)\, in 2027\n\nMore: https://air-artistvillage.org.tw/?u
 tm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
